      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process**, not held in the Hub\u0027s own process environment. Specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the environment of the spawned agent (Ingest or Query) child process, immediately before that process starts\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated\n\nThis scoping model means a compromised or misbehaving Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables \u2014 the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API.",
